 Today's newsletter is 916 words, a 3½-minute read. 

 📉 The dashboard: The S&amp;P 500 closed down 0.5%.

 Oil prices came down from earlier highs this morning after President Trump said the U.S. would not attack Iran ahead of the Nov. 3 midterm elections. 🥶 Situational awareness: AI stocks sank following a report by FT that OpenAI's annualized revenue at the end of September was roughly $50 billion — significantly below the $68 billion figure widely reported last month.

 
 
